{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_021mat_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_021mat_009_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "cdba75a2d148b01315f5bbd226ebe5b1b074250f906daf2eba985be95b4001fb", "ja": "ありがとうなのです！　でも、姫は普通にしているだけ\nなのですよ？　生まれたときからフワフワなのです！", "zh": "谢谢你！不过，公主只是做平常的自己而已哦？从出生起就是轻飘飘的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_021mat_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_021mat_009_1005_p", "source_sha256": "049959b326f70734be6b80e9359a6afd6aaea158217ab64b3a253eca0f1e51f1", "ja": "まつり、お疲れさま！\nそれから……。", "zh": "茉莉，辛苦了！\n还有就是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
